{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Piczle World of Puzzles",
    "steam_appid": 2174300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/bc9da91e5b232f1908bdca72187b73d3.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like logic-puzzles? <i>Of course you do</i>, what a silly question! Piczle World of Puzzles brings together all your favourite Piczle puzzles in one addictive package!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From classic nonograms to colour logic-puzzles, from challenging brain-scratchers to relaxing mind-calmers, Piczle World of Puzzles is packed <i>to the hilt</i>, the <i>hilt </i>I say,\u00a0 with picture-based logic-puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Piczle Cross</strong> are classic nonograms. <strong>Piczle Color Cross</strong> are colour nonograms. <strong>Piczle Colors</strong> <i>(Currently under construction)</i> are a brain-bending variation on regular nonograms. <strong>Piczle Lines</strong> <i>(Currently under construction)</i> offers relaxing pixel-art based puzzling. And\u2026more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/e004c340d898c10f293fff464d4bbce6.poster.avif?t=1752550042\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/e004c340d898c10f293fff464d4bbce6.webm?t=1752550042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/e004c340d898c10f293fff464d4bbce6.mp4?t=1752550042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/28eb36870682c8e8fcddab75a38ba2a6.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Piczle Academy you won\u2019t just learn how each logic-puzzle works or how to use the many, many gameplay options and tools at your disposal, it will also make you better at puzzling! Learn advanced techniques and challenge yourself with a series of brain-bending logic quizzes to hone your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/2c139bafd80d7966855aac86bf45615d.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no wrong way to play. At Piczle Academy you learn about all the different ways to enjoy the puzzles on your own terms. Whether you are a seasoned logic-puzzler or a curious beginner, Piczle World of Puzzles is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/9e74a148317fad1a980b3bccb7cb7a7b.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create, test and share your own puzzles with the Piczle community. Or play puzzles created by other Piczle players! Use intuitive editors and get feedback on your creations to put together\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Currently under construction)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/1ea7244a063045844c245da3920188d2.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div>Piczle World of Puzzles is free to start and offers copious amounts of free content. Daily puzzles, seasonal puzzle packs, a drip-feed of free puzzles will keep you occupied without spending a penny! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/42e67075a98aa3ae556fb11c5cbb955f.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For players who wish to support Score Studios, or for those hungry for even more there are DLC packages for each specific puzzle type to get more of the content you want, as well as some extras like profile stickers and puzzle themes!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/bc9da91e5b232f1908bdca72187b73d3.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like logic-puzzles? <i>Of course you do</i>, what a silly question! Piczle World of Puzzles brings together all your favourite Piczle puzzles in one addictive package!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From classic nonograms to colour logic-puzzles, from challenging brain-scratchers to relaxing mind-calmers, Piczle World of Puzzles is packed <i>to the hilt</i>, the <i>hilt </i>I say,\u00a0 with picture-based logic-puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Piczle Cross</strong> are classic nonograms. <strong>Piczle Color Cross</strong> are colour nonograms. <strong>Piczle Colors</strong> <i>(Currently under construction)</i> are a brain-bending variation on regular nonograms. <strong>Piczle Lines</strong> <i>(Currently under construction)</i> offers relaxing pixel-art based puzzling. And\u2026more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/e004c340d898c10f293fff464d4bbce6.poster.avif?t=1752550042\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/e004c340d898c10f293fff464d4bbce6.webm?t=1752550042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/e004c340d898c10f293fff464d4bbce6.mp4?t=1752550042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/28eb36870682c8e8fcddab75a38ba2a6.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At Piczle Academy you won\u2019t just learn how each logic-puzzle works or how to use the many, many gameplay options and tools at your disposal, it will also make you better at puzzling! Learn advanced techniques and challenge yourself with a series of brain-bending logic quizzes to hone your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/2c139bafd80d7966855aac86bf45615d.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no wrong way to play. At Piczle Academy you learn about all the different ways to enjoy the puzzles on your own terms. Whether you are a seasoned logic-puzzler or a curious beginner, Piczle World of Puzzles is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/9e74a148317fad1a980b3bccb7cb7a7b.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create, test and share your own puzzles with the Piczle community. Or play puzzles created by other Piczle players! Use intuitive editors and get feedback on your creations to put together\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Currently under construction)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/1ea7244a063045844c245da3920188d2.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div>Piczle World of Puzzles is free to start and offers copious amounts of free content. Daily puzzles, seasonal puzzle packs, a drip-feed of free puzzles will keep you occupied without spending a penny! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/42e67075a98aa3ae556fb11c5cbb955f.avif?t=1752550042\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For players who wish to support Score Studios, or for those hungry for even more there are DLC packages for each specific puzzle type to get more of the content you want, as well as some extras like profile stickers and puzzle themes!</p>",
